-
-### 6a. Documentation Index (llms.txt)
-
-```bash
-curl -s https://langfuse.com/llms.txt
-```
-
-Returns structured list of every doc page. Use to discover the right page, then fetch it.
-
-### 6b. Fetch Pages as Markdown
-
